invalid type: string "Gold Price Prediction Using Machine Learning \n \nPage | 24  \nMount Carmel College | Bengaluru  \n \n \n \nYearly trend of gold price movement \n  \nGold prices  have a increasing &  decreasing trend  , it is because of \nthe festivals(Diwali & Akshaya Tritiya)  or the marriages. \nDuring theses auspicious days people start buying  gold  & hence prices \nof gold rises."ÿÿÿÿÿ